{"title":"Contemporary Oil Paintings by Sebas Velasco","link":"https://kottke.org/25/04/contemporary-oil-paintings-by-sebas-velasco","date":1744989097000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sebas-velasco-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sebas-velasco-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sebas-velasco-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1622\" alt=\"oil painting of a young woman at night\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sebas-velasco-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sebas-velasco-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sebas-velasco-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1300\" alt=\"oil painting of a silver car and a blue car in front of an apartment building\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sebas-velasco-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sebas-velasco-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sebas-velasco-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1300\" alt=\"oil painting of a man in a white hoodie looking down at his phone\" /></p>\n\n<p>Spanish artist <a href=\"https://www.sebasvelasco.com/painting.html\">Sebas Velasco</a> does these cool oil paintings that seem more like snapshots than conventional portraiture, still life, or landscape. They’re captured from the height &amp; distance of a camera, they have photographic depth-of-field, etc. I like them a lot. (via <a href=\"https://www.thisiscolossal.com/2025/04/sebas-velasco-the-morning-will-change-everything/\">colossal</a>)</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Sebas%20Velasco\">Sebas Velasco</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/04/contemporary-oil-paintings-by-sebas-velasco\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"0825a5bea26ee157061e9aa8d3605df41d487a4e895f9b08ea109e4f9d094fca","category":"Sites"}